# Files Cline should not list, search, or auto-load (gitignore syntax).
# Saves tokens on the Gemini free tier. Not a security boundary: @-mentions still work,
# and the PreToolUse hook in .clinerules/hooks/ is what blocks edits to secrets.
# Note: Cline docs mark .clineignore as "will be deprecated soon".

**/node_modules/
venv/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.sqlite3
.env
.env.*
frontEnd/.expo/
frontEnd/package-lock.json
frontEnd/assets/images/
*.pdf
.DS_Store

# Acceptance tests: test passwords, the web build, and Run For Record results (screenshots, .docx)
frontEnd/acceptance/logins.json
frontEnd/acceptance/results/
frontEnd/dist/
